{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwS4NAoEn8UQ2EfEFgHm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I created the dashboard and the alert rule, and the rule is enabled. Kibana reads both back with the expected settings and the rule's first status is `ok`. I didn't open the dashboard in a browser, so I haven't seen the charts render.\n\n**1. What the data holds.** `kibana_sample_data_logs` has about 14,000 web requests, with `timestamp` as the time field, running from 2026-10-04 to 2026-12-03. Each record has the client IP, the response code, bytes sent, URL, host, file extension, operating system, location fields (`geo.src` / `geo.dest`) and user agent. Only three response codes appear:\n\n| Response | Requests | Avg bytes |\n|---|---|---|\n| 200 | 12,832 | ~5,898 |\n| 404 | 801 | ~5,049 |\n| 503 | 441 | 0 |\n\n**2. Dashboard: \"EFF-33d79933 Web logs overview\"** ([open](http://localhost:15601/app/dashboards#/view/eff-33d79933-web-logs-overview-c208592cc152)). It has 7 panels and a default time range of the last 7 days:\n- Total requests (single number)\n- Unique visitors, counted as distinct client IPs (single number)\n- Average bytes per request (single number)\n- Requests over time, split by response code (bar chart)\n- Share of each response code (pie chart)\n- Top 10 requested URLs, with request count and total bytes (table)\n- Top 10 source countries (bar chart)\n\n**3. Alert rule: \"EFF-33d79933 5xx spike\"** (id `9f69aa03-6ce1-41a2-bc5c-58259a632bc7`). It runs every minute against `kibana_sample_data_logs`. It counts requests whose response code starts with \"5\" over the last 5 minutes and fires when the count is more than 10. Today that only catches 503s, but other 5xx codes would count too. The rule has no notification action attached, so a firing alert will show up in Kibana but won't send a message anywhere."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":411,"cache_read_input_tokens":22006,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":411},"output_tokens":672,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4eb1cb7-866c-5bbf-8d81-a8d5acd83be3","uuid":"ce4313f9-b082-4b1a-a90e-aa1a18c6b7ac","timestamp":"2026-10-12T00:56:12.306Z","request_id":"req_011CfwS4Mxep7wjaGVDZp6Am"}
